ut \"uv run pytest tests/integration/sources/test_pubmed_fetch.py\" — importing another test module is fine (test_ctgov_fetch_cli.py does it).\n\nCLI tests:\na) `test_fetch_pubmed_cli_prints_pointer_and_writes_receipt`:\n```python\nproject = _project(tmp_path)\npages = Pages([_esearch_payload(1,0,1,[\"111\"]), _efetch_xml(\"111\")])\nmonkeypatch.setattr(pubmed_fetch, \"_download\", pages)\ncode = main([\"research\", \"fetch-pubmed\", \"--project\", str(project), \"--term\", \"合成检索式\"])\nassert code == 0\nout = capsys.readouterr().out\nassert \"合成摘要\" not in out          # 不回显正文\npointer = json.loads(out)\nassert pointer[\"status\"] == \"complete\" and pointer[\"records\"] == 1 and pointer[\"universe_closed\"] is False\nreceipt = json.loads((project / pointer[\"capture_path\"]).read_bytes())\nassert receipt[\"acquisition\"][\"temporal_scope\"] == \"current_records\"\nassert receipt[\"acquisition\"][\"universe_closed\"] is False\nassert receipt[\"record_count\"] == 1\nassert receipt[\"records\"][0][\"pmid\"] == \"111\"\nassert \"abstract\" not in receipt[\"records\"][0]   # hmm, decide\n```\nb) `test_fetch_pubmed_cli_fails_closed_on_network_error`:\n```python\npages = Pages([TimeoutError()])\ncode = main([...])\nassert code == 7\npointer = json.loads(out); assert pointer[\"status\"] == \"network_error\"; assert pointer[\"records\"] == 0\nreceipt = ...; assert receipt[\"acquisition\"][\"status\"] == \"network_error\"\n```\nc) `test_fetch_pubmed_cli_argument_validation`:\n```python\nwith pytest.raises(SystemExit) as excinfo: main([\"research\",\"fetch-pubmed\",\"--root\",str(project)])\nassert excinfo.value.code == 2\n```\nHmm — `main` calls `parser.parse_args` which calls `self.exit(2, ...)` → SystemExit. Let me check how main handles SystemExit. Let me look at main().\n\nAlso missing --term → SystemExit(2) with \"缺少必填参数\". And invalid --page-size (e.g. 0) → ValueError → ContractError? The handler passes page_size to fetch_pubmed_results which validates → raises ValueE